 "Run all you like. The city will still be here when you stop.": "",
 "My house. Don’t touch the furniture. There isn’t any.": "",
 "The Mother of the Gods lets me sleep on her doorstep. She has never complained. Her priests have.": "",
 "Myrrhine’s figs are the best in Miletus. I know because she has never given me one.": "",
 "Bronze heroes. Easy to admire. They never ask you for anything.": "",
 "That’s one of the Scythian archers. The city keeps them to keep its citizens in line. Think about that.": "",
 "If you’re waiting for me to lead, we’ll be here until the next Olympics.": "",
 "This is the only hour when Miletus looks honest.": "",
 "Night. Now my lamp looks a little less ridiculous.": "",
 "The night watch is out. Keep your hands to yourself and they’ll leave you alone. Unlike me.": "",
 "Move. You’re standing in my sunlight.": "",
 "The dogs like you. Don’t let it go to your head. They like anyone who might drop food.": "",
 "Rain. A free bath. You’re welcome.": "",
 ", text: ": "",
 "Figs from Attica, sweet as honey! Two obols for you, stranger.": "",
 "For him? Nothing. Ever.": "",
 "You see? An honest woman. Rude, but honest.": "",
 "Keep out of trouble, foreigner. The gates close after dark, and I run faster than you.": "",
 "Still looking? Good. Keep looking.": "",
 "A stranger in very strange clothes. Tell me, young man: what are you looking for?": "",
 "The parts of the car. It broke.": "",
 "A broken machine. Do you know what it was for, or only what it was made of?": "",
 "Honestly? I have no idea.": "",
 "Just looking around.": "",
 "Looking is easy. Seeing takes practice. Come back when you have a question.": "",
